e RTS handed out (hs_spt_lookup's, HES88)"] [332 1 "// takeMVar takes (or reads) an MVar's value, blocking while it is empty; a woken taker gets the"] [333 1 "// putter's value directly (GHC's single wake-up, FIFO)."] [345 3 "// a reader goes first: a put serves every reader before the first taker (stg_readMVarzh; review 189, F3)"] [354 1 "// mvarTaken empties an MVar, a blocked putter's value put in."] [372 1 "// putMVar puts a value, blocking while the MVar is full; readers and the first taker woken."]] :go/pos {:name [1 9] :package [1 1]} :go/semis [[38 38] [68 25] [95 80] [95 97] [221 27] [318 29] [322 28]]} (go/file "prim_ctl.go" :imports [


